sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over B,DB: 1. LOGIN
    B->>S: POST /login (email, password)
    S->>DB: SELECT user_id, name, password FROM users WHERE email=...
    DB-->>S: user_id = 7, password matches
    S->>S: generateSessionId() gives 32 random hex chars
    S->>DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions (session_id, user_id)
    Note right of DB: is_active=TRUE, login_time=NOW (defaults)
    S-->>B: 200 OK + Set-Cookie session_id=ab12... HttpOnly SameSite=Lax

    Note over B,DB: 2. EVERY LATER REQUEST
    B->>S: GET /cart (browser auto-sends Cookie session_id=ab12...)
    S->>DB: SELECT user_id FROM user_sessions WHERE session_id=... AND is_active=TRUE
    DB-->>S: user_id = 7
    S->>DB: UPDATE user_sessions SET last_activity=NOW
    S-->>B: cart page for user 7

    Note over B,DB: 3. LOGOUT
    B->>S: GET /logout
    S->>DB: UPDATE user_sessions SET is_active=FALSE, logout_time=NOW
    S-->>B: Set-Cookie session_id= (expired 1970) so the browser deletes it

    Note over B,DB: 4. AFTER LOGOUT
    B->>S: GET /cart (no cookie, or old id)
    S->>DB: lookup finds no active row
    S-->>B: Please log in first
